<title>POLAND: Echo Q2 net rises to PLN 9.6 mln.</title>
<headline>Echo Q2 net rises to PLN 9.6 mln.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-08-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Echo preliminary results for the second quarter of the year ending June 30, 1997.</p>
<p>(Figures in millions of zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>						Q2 1997	Q2 1996</p>
<p>    operating profit			11.21 vs	1.05</p>
<p>    pre-tax profit			  10.01 vs	1.47</p>
<p>    net profit				 9.56 vs	0.77</p>
<p>NOTE - full company name is: Echo Investment SA.</p>
<p>    net sales				 22.74 vs	4.52</p>
<p>    costs of sales			  11.68 vs	3.49</p>
<p>    extraordinary profit		     na vs	  na</p>
<p>    income tax				 0.45 vs	0.70</p>
<p>    other taxes				  na vs	  na</p>
<p>    financial revenues		    0.31  vs	1.48</p>
<p>    financial costs			 1.50  vs	1.07</p>
<p>    investment				6.65  vs	3.56</p>
<p>						H1 1997	H1 1996</p>
<p>    operating profit		     12.93  vs	1.52</p>
<p>    pre-tax profit			 11.08  vs	2.04</p>
<p>    net profit			     10.28  vs	1.12</p>
<p>    net sales				29.30  vs	7.25</p>
<p>    costs of sales			 16.52  vs	5.75</p>
<p>    extraordinary profit		    na  vs	  na</p>
<p>    income tax				0.80  vs	0.92</p>
<p>    other taxes				 na  vs	  na</p>
<p>    financial revenues		    0.77  vs	2.27</p>
<p>    financial costs			 2.62  vs	1.75</p>
<p>    investment				  na  vs	  na</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
